From 750e5f1f7acdff4a3f3e2ce86e9a7a5421f95c8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nmcintosh <nathanielstewartmcintosh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:06:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] launcher: quiet boot: black with the NixOS snowflake, no
 progress pill

The boot and shutdown overlay is black with the NixOS snowflake in the middle and no
text but a failed boot's; it fades into the guest's picture on ready. No progress pill
while booting or shutting down (the no-picture report after ready stays). Self-tests
follow.
